The way Snagless resolves type names from syntax alone (recording each reference with its lexical scope, then
resolving it against declared types in the compiler's lookup order, and keying types by module) was informed by
SafeDI, https://github.com/dfed/SafeDI, Copyright (c) 2023 Dan Federman, MIT License. No SafeDI source code is
included.

